    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CARGO 19, your main objective is to take a contract in the hangar, which will specify how many resources you need to collect for your mission. Every decision you make matters! Explore various locations, gathering resources to create new sites: choose between rocky landscapes, dense forests, or rich mines. Each location offers unique resources, and you must plan your route carefully to maximize fuel efficiency and avoid damaging your ship.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156720/extras/50bd3e2c4a54eec1c4d6a91d016137c6.avif?t=1732037207\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will complete contracts, face various challenges, and upgrade your hangar. Roguelike elements add unpredictability to the game: each playthrough is unique, and every move requires careful planning. Explore the desert lands, gather resources, and carve your path to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156720/extras/5f6a68ef83cfa71dac04f0e074cd767c.avif?t=1732037207\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a great pilot and explore the mysterious world of CARGO 19! Are you ready for the challenge?</p>",
